1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,700
Two plates, under six euros.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,300
Wash the tomatoes.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:11,300
Slice them nice and thin.

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,900
Chop the garlic very fine.

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,100
And the onion too.

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:22,400
A little ginger. It's optional.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,000
A good glug of olive oil.

8
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,500
Squeeze in half a lemon.

9
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,500
A spoon of honey.

10
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:36,300
Some coarse salt.

11
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,300
Black pepper.

12
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,300
Whisk hard until it emulsifies.

13
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:47,300
Lay the tomatoes on a plate.

14
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:51,300
Spoon the dressing over.

15
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,800
Peel the skin off the sausage.

16
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,300
Chop the sausage.

17
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:01,800
Brown it, high heat.

18
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,300
A splash of white wine.

19
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:08,800
Let it bubble and reduce.

20
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:13,300
Lay the sausage over the tomatoes.

21
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:16,300
Pour the juices on top.

22
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:19,800
And it's ready to eat.

23
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:25,800
About six euros for two. Under three a serving.
